  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The maximum number of hero points you may have at a time increases by 1. When you enter Aristeia, you gain a single temporary hero point which lasts for the duration of Aristeia and cannot be used with the Heroic Perseverance feat. When you enter Aristeia level 3 or higher, you gain two temporary hero points instead of one.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> This feat counts as Hero’s Fortune for the purpose of meeting prerequisites.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/aristeia-feats#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
